{"site":"douban","sid":"6748086","imdb_id":"tt2098220","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt2098220/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/6748086/","chinese_title":"全职猎人2011","foreign_title":"HUNTER×HUNTER","year":"2011","aka":["新全职猎人"],"region":["日本"],"genre":["剧情","动画","冒险"],"language":["日语"],"playdate":["2011-10-02(日本)"],"episodes":"148","duration":"24分钟","description":"小杰富力士（潘惠美 配音）自幼失去双亲，由婶婶抚养长大，自由的大海和幽深的森林培养了他得天独厚的敏锐和豁达。长大后的小杰偶然得知，自己的父亲并没有死亡，并且留给了他一个任务，这个任务就是：成为“猎人”，然后找到他。“猎人”，那个时代最风光的职业，经过层层挑战千挑万选，只有最最优秀的人才能够获得猎人执照，而有了这张执照，便可以在这个凶险的世界里更自如的生存下去。为了追随父亲的脚步，小杰上路了。这一路暗礁重重，但是小杰凭借自己的本能结识了优秀的朋友，志愿成为医生的雷欧力（藤原启治 配音），最后一个窟卢塔族酷拉皮卡（泽城美雪 配音），还有他这辈子最重要的同伴奇犽（伊濑茉莉也 配音）。此外，那宿命中的敌人们也出现了——幻影旅团。\n本动画为2011年MADEHOUSE公司的重制版，剧情上和旧版没有区别，但启用了全新的声优阵容，在制作上也更加的精美细致。","poster":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p1948194075.jpg","douban_votes":"54809","douban_rating":"9.4","imdb_rating_average":"9.0","imdb_votes":"207311","imdb_rating":"9.0 / 10 from 207,311 users","director":[{"name":"神志那弘志 Hiroshi Kôjina","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27227330/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/0d97744ae0e2954bc444f52e97248454.jpg"},{"name":"青木弘安 Aoki Hiroyasu","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/34979860/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"},{"name":"矢岛哲生 Tetsuo Yajima","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/30412245/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/c27e4e49b4cec6e63233523a4602244a.jpg"},{"name":"米田和弘 Kazuhiro Yoneda","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27588455/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1510399930.88.webp"},{"name":"高桥知也 Takahashi Tomoya","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/34903619/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee